        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          88      Heic Kandic Kabamv Kathuihna khou",
            "                             9.7.10.5. 12.7.Ref. 9.8. 11.7",
            "          Doh hei F",
            "",
            "          1. Heic kandic kabamv kathuihna khou,",
            "             Ryanraa lakmei khwan raana.",
            "             Tingpuk kandih 'maan changh kan pwni the;",
            "             Tingsaengc pwlak khe.",
            "             Baibal khou saaloumei hei guang khithkhit pwthe;",
            "             Kandih mai rui raw pwni.",
            "",
            "                  Poubauhmei guang datmei ganv khou kiu,",
            "                  Kandih khouhei tanc-bauhmei guay,",
            "                  Nkamh khang tei kabamv nai dat pwlak khe,",
            "                  Ravguangc Lauziu Nac hu khou.",
            "",
            "          2. 'Dih khou ramhkhe swna liantimei,",
            "             Nang ping thayna lunghlaic o;",
            "             Nang ruc khoutei latzan sw khang ruina",
            "             Poubauhmei guang the;",
            "             Maansei nac mwang rui daw hzih ngam pwlak ge;",
            "             Ravguangc Lauzíu Nac hu khoutei.",
            "",
            "          3. Kandih khou nang taanv tynmei khangsuangc,",
            "             Nang bumaengc khangrui 'tyn o.",
            "             Nai dat pwlak khe 'maan ngam pwni the,",
            "             Nang tuang syan-lanv guay.",
            "             Ntaw kaganv gay khou kunghmei nang bumaengc ta",
            "             Gulou ngam khang chamdaanv la tho."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
